<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-SVORODA WINS SECOND STAGE OF TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-SVORODA WINS SECOND STAGE OF TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>LLEIDA, Spain 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan Svorada of Slovakia won the 164-km second stage of the Tour of Catalonia from Port Aventura on Friday.</p>
<p>Chris Boardman of Britain retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
